  1154	    "note": "VIX carries a variance risk premium, so its level sits above the physical conditional vol of the GARCH null. Under fixed thresholds (variant A) the simulation therefore over-populates the calm regime relative to the data. Variant B removes this by matching regime occupancy and shock rate by construction."
